---
title: News
permalink: /news/
eyebrowText: From the association
intro: "Announcements, meetings, race results and events from PNWORCA."
description: "PNWORCA news: announcements, board meetings, race results and outrigger events in the Pacific Northwest."
---
<ul style="list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(min(100%, 340px), 1fr)); gap: 20px">
{% for n in news %}<li><a href="/{{ n.slug }}/" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; height: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid #E1E7EC; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; text-decoration: none; color: #221D35; background: #FFFFFF">
{% if n.image %}<img src="{{ n.image }}" srcset="{{ n.image | srcset }}" sizes="(min-width: 760px) 400px, 100vw" width="{{ n.image | imgW }}" height="{{ n.image | imgH }}" alt="" loading="lazy" style="width: 100%; height: 190px; object-fit: cover; display: block; background: #F6F5F5">{% endif %}
<span style="padding: 18px 20px 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px">
<span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #283485">{{ n.date | dayLong }} · {{ n.category }}</span>
<span class="cond" style="font-size: 26px; line-height: 1; color: #1E2427">{{ n.title }}</span>
{% if n.excerpt %}<span style="font-size: 15px; color: #4A4458">{{ n.excerpt }}</span>{% endif %}
</span>
</a></li>
{% endfor %}</ul>
